OL,3,APassengers sleep on floors and describe
OL,4,Aairport 'carnage' as hundreds more
OL,5,Aflights cancelled
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We're exhausted," one family tell us
OL,8,Fabout spending the night on the airport
OL,9,Ffloor; another passenger describes
OL,10,F"carnage" at Gatwick baggage reclaim
OL,11,Fafter his flight was cancelled
OL,13,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,14,Fblamed a technical glitch with its
OL,15,Fflight processing system - the firm's
OL,16,Fboss Martin Rolfe says there will be an
OL,17,Finvestigation
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
